ed, catering to a wide array of tasks and queries with enhanced precision and flexibility."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_b5d8e0c839c60e39","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":22,"quote":"22 B Dataset Comparison To analyze the differences between the three datasets we use, we pay special attention to the quality of the distractor passages, i.e., whether they can be effectively confounded with the supporting passages."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_1ba1c10f72bfe2f9","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":9,"quote":"The effectiveness of this approach relies on 9 accurate entity recognition conducted by the query processor and the quality of labeled entities on graph nodes."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_9f8adcbc9d991713","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":12,"quote":"These abilities are critical for the model’s performance under various challenges and complex scenarios, impacting the quality scores."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_5378afbd1af02420","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":7,"quote":"Thus, we resort to man- ual evaluation, focusing on three key aspects that reflect the intrinsic quality of an extracted KG: • Precision: The canonicalized triplets remain correct and meaningful with respect to the text compared to the OIE"},{"id":"c15","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_5a8ae7af32a9d1fc","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":3,"quote":"This phase can also suffer from irrelevance, toxicity, or bias in the outputs, detracting from the quality and reliability of the responses."},{"id":"c16","ch